              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#79706e' fontsize='9'>Sources: BFw Mission Data Daily, Berliner Feuerwehr, Berlin 2026 (CC BY 4.0) · Deutscher Wetterdienst (DWD): station 00433 Berlin-Tempelhof, daily max temperature, and historical heat warnings.   EMS demand index = day&apos;s missions ÷ that summer&apos;s average × 100.   Associations, not proof of cause and effect.</run>
