    </dashboard>
    <dashboard name='Forecast'>
      <style />
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='100000' id='3' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <zone fixed-size='66' h='11078' id='4' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Berlin Under Heat: a forecast experiment</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#79706e' fontsize='11'>Retrospective experiment with measured temperature in place of a weather forecast · trained on 2018–2025 · tested on summer 2026</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='100' h='14970' id='5' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='11078'>
              <zone h='14970' id='6' name='KPI 5 — Forecast gain' show-title='false' w='50000' x='0' y='11078'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#d4d4d4' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='6' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='14970' id='7' name='KPI 6 — Typical error' show-title='false' w='50000' x='50000' y='11078'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#d4d4d4' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='6' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone h='36000' id='8' name='05 — Forecast vs Actual 2026' w='100000' x='0' y='26048'>
              <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone h='31664' id='9' name='06 — Forecast Error by Model' w='100000' x='0' y='62048'>
              <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='34' h='6288' id='10' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='93712'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#79706e' fontsize='9'>Model: linear regression on average missions and temperature of the previous 7 days, the day&apos;s maximum temperature, weekday and month.   Naive forecast = average of the previous 7 days.   Error = mean absolute error.   Measured temperature stands in for a weather forecast, so real forecast errors would be larger.   Sources: BFw Mission Data Daily, Berliner Feuerwehr, Berlin 2026 (CC BY 4.0) · Deutscher Wetterdienst (DWD), station 00433 Berlin-Tempelhof.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{7FFF4366-885C-4536-92AB-32859BACDED4}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard name='Impact'>
      <style />
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='100000' id='3' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <zone fixed-size='66' h='11078' id='4' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Berlin Under Heat: hot days in numbers</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#79706e' fontsize='11'>More emergency medical (EMS) missions and longer response times on hot days · June–August 2018–2026 · full-year view January 2018 – November 2026</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='100' h='14970' id='5' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='11078'>
              <zone h='14970' id='6' name='KPI 7 — Missions per hot day' show-title='false' w='33333' x='0' y='11078'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#d4d4d4' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='6' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='14970' id='7' name='KPI 8 — Missions per summer' show-title='false' w='33334' x='33333' y='11078'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#d4d4d4' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='6' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='14970' id='8' name='KPI 9 — Response time' show-title='false' w='33333' x='66667' y='11078'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#d4d4d4' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='6' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone h='67664' id='9' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='26048'>
              <zone h='67664' id='10' name='07 — Response Time per Summer' w='50000' x='0' y='26048'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='67664' id='11' name='08 — Demand by Temperature, Full Year' w='50000' x='50000' y='26048'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='34' h='6288' id='12' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='93712'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#79706e' fontsize='9'>Mission and response-time differences: regression estimates adjusted for year, month and weekday; associations, not proof of cause and effect.   Response time = mission creation to arrival of the first vehicle, plus 2 minutes; critical EMS missions only.   Full-year chart: descriptive, demand relative to the average day of the same year.   Sources: BFw Mission Data Daily, Berliner Feuerwehr, Berlin 2026 (CC BY 4.0) · Deutscher Wetterdienst (DWD), station 00433 Berlin-Tempelhof.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{D2650ACA-DE26-48BF-A523-59B90B4CFB55}' />
    </dashboard>
